        "description": "## Overview\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Infinite loop via `Label.resolve()` in the `Label` class. An attacker can hang `ClassReader.accept()` by supplying a crafted class file whose transformed method grows beyond 65,535 bytes, denying service to build tools, instrumenters, agents, or analyzers processing it.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.ow2.asm:asm` to version 9.11.1 or higher.\n## References\n- [GitLab Commit](https://gitlab.ow2.org/asm/asm/-/commit/4bb1a4701e7b61c2163525b987a96a8db815cb68)\n- [gitlab.ow2.org](https://gitlab.ow2.org/asm/asm/-/blob/ASM_9_11/asm/src/main/java/org/objectweb/asm/Label.java#L417)\n- [gitlab.ow2.org](https://gitlab.ow2.org/asm/asm/-/merge_requests/480)\n- [Red Hat Bugzilla Bug](https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2554778)\n",
